Butler Push for Hermes, version 1.0.3.

Based on the MIT-licensed Hermex Push plugin by Uzair Ansar:
https://github.com/uzairansaruzi/hermex-push
Upstream source revision: 2da6f660bb86e9470ea56c85dc554aba45ce7fdf

Reuse includes the notification lifecycle/coalescer, relay sender, payload
encoding, preview encryption/AAD, plugin entry/adapter, profile dispatch,
dashboard API shapes and selected tests, adapted for Butler. The original MIT
license and copyright notice remain in LICENSE. Butler implements independent
configuration and key storage, reduced outgoing data and a push-only API; the
original relay and unrelated companion tools are not included in this package.
